SUMMARY:Josie and the Pussycats
LOCATION:Amherst Cinema\, 28 Amity St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:Late Nights\nHot newcomers Josie (Rachael Leigh Cook)\, Melody 
 (Tara Reid)\, and Val (Rosario Dawson) are three small-town musicians with
  big dreams but little future. Then fate gives the Pussycats the chance of
  a lifetime when band manager Wyatt (Alan Cumming) of MegaRecords signs th
 em overnight to an awesome recording contract.\nhttps://amherstcinema.org/
 films-and-events/josie-and-pussycats\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://p
 ushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://amherstcinema.org/films-and-events/josie-and-pussycats
END:VEVENT
